cff-version: 1.2.0
title: falsifiable-targets-workflow
message: >-
  If you use this workflow layer in your research, please cite both this
  repository and the underlying falsifiable-targets engine.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: crisprking
repository-code: 'https://github.com/crisprking/falsifiable-targets-workflow'
abstract: >-
  Parallel batch-auditing layer for the falsifiable-targets drug-target
  validation engine. Provides three equivalent execution paths
  (standalone Python, Nextflow, Snakemake) producing identical audit
  reports, plus an HTML dashboard and CI-friendly exit codes.
keywords:
  - drug discovery
  - target validation
  - workflow
  - nextflow
  - snakemake
  - reproducibility
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-05-26'
references:
  - type: software
    title: falsifiable-targets
    repository-code: 'https://github.com/crisprking/falsifiable-targets'
    version: '1.4.1'
    notes: >-
